@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - 002 Template Import, Group Question Round & Multi-Blank Writeback

actor Teacher
participant "Teacher Import UI" as ImportUI
participant "Teacher Round Control" as RoundUI
participant "Route Handlers" as API
participant "Worksheet Parser" as Parser
participant "Google Sheets Adapter" as SheetsAccess
participant "Guided Notes Sheet" as Sheet
participant "Round Store (Lua)" as Redis
participant "Student Answer Form" as Student
participant "Writeback Worker" as Worker

== Import ==
Teacher -> ImportUI : Pick spreadsheet in Google Picker
ImportUI -> API : GET /api/sheets/{id}/tabs
API -> SheetsAccess : spreadsheets.get(properties only)
SheetsAccess --> API : tabs (sheetId, title)
API --> ImportUI : tab list
alt exactly one tab
  ImportUI -> ImportUI : auto-select tab
else several tabs
  Teacher -> ImportUI : choose tab by name
end
ImportUI -> API : POST /api/activities/import
API -> SheetsAccess : readWorksheet(grid + merges)
SheetsAccess -> Sheet : spreadsheets.get(includeGridData)
Sheet --> SheetsAccess : cells + merges
API -> Parser : parseWorksheetGrid
Parser -> Parser : find header row (題號 / 題目 / 作答)
Parser -> Parser : group rows by merged / repeated number\nand unnumbered sub-rows
Parser --> API : questions (single | group, blanks) + issues
alt blocking issues
  API --> ImportUI : 422 with per-question issues (number, row)
else valid
  API -> Redis : save activity + structure snapshot
  API --> ImportUI : 201 preview (blanks per question)
end

== Group question round ==
Teacher -> RoundUI : Open question 1 (group, 2 blanks)
RoundUI -> API : POST rounds/open
API -> Redis : Lua open-round (store blanks)
Redis --> Student : phase.changed {blanks: [(1), (2)]}
Student -> API : POST submissions {answers: [a1, a2]}
API -> Redis : Lua submit-answer\n(reject if count != blanks or any blank empty)
Redis --> Student : own receipt (answers)
Teacher -> RoundUI : Close question
RoundUI -> API : POST rounds/{roundId}/close
API -> Redis : Lua close-round
Redis --> RoundUI : results.finalized (answers per group)

== Writeback (any completed question) ==
Teacher -> RoundUI : Write back question 1 (from completed list)
RoundUI -> API : POST rounds/{roundId}/writeback
API -> Redis : enqueue job (answers[])
Worker -> Redis : XREADGROUP job
Worker -> SheetsAccess : readWorksheet
Worker -> Parser : parse + structure snapshot
alt snapshot differs from import
  Worker -> Redis : status failed (structure changed)
else snapshot equal
  alt target cells already hold label + answers
    Worker -> Redis : status succeeded (idempotent replay)
  else
    Worker -> SheetsAccess : RAW write label + answers[i] per blank
    SheetsAccess -> Sheet : values.batchUpdate
    Worker -> SheetsAccess : re-read and verify target cells
    Worker -> Redis : status succeeded
  end
end
@enduml
